1:["$","main",null,{"className":"reading-page post-reading-page","children":["$","article",null,{"className":"post-article h-entry","children":[["$","$L7",null,{"className":"u-url sr-only","href":"/blog/fosa/fosa-ch14","children":["FOSA丨14丨事件驱动架构"," 永久链接"]}],["$","a",null,{"className":"p-author h-card sr-only","href":"https://github.com/hedon954","rel":"author","children":"Hedon"}],"$undefined",["$","header",null,{"className":"article-header article-summary-row","children":[["$","p",null,{"className":"eyebrow","children":"架构设计"}],["$","h1",null,{"className":"p-name","children":"FOSA丨14丨事件驱动架构"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"article-deck p-summary","children":"本篇通过回答《Fundamentals of Software Architecture》第十四章的课后思考题，深入探讨事件驱动架构中代理拓扑与中介者拓扑的设计差异、异步通信的优势机制、请求模式与事件模式的应用场景，以及事件类型分类、消息可靠性保障技术和架构特性支持分析，帮助理解事件驱动架构的核心设计原理和实施策略，提升架构师在构建响应式系统时的架构选择能力和事件化设计水平。"}],["$","div",null,{"className":"article-meta","children":[["$","time",null,{"className":"dt-published","dateTime":"2025-07-18T10:30:00.000Z","children":["发布于 ","2025/07/18"]}],"$undefined",["$","span",null,{"children":"$undefined"}],["$","span",null,{"children":["约 ","3,999"," 字"]}]]}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"article-reading-layout","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"article-reading-column","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"e-content","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"markdown-body","children":[["$","p","p-0",{"children":["本系列文章通过逐章回答",["$","a","a-0",{"href":"https://fundamentalsofsoftwarearchitecture.com/","node":{"type":"element","tagName":"a","properties":{"href":"https://fundamentalsofsoftwarearchitecture.com/"},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"《Fundamentals of Software Architecture》","position":{"start":{"line":1,"column":13,"offset":12},"end":{"line":1,"column":52,"offset":51}}}],"position":{"start":{"line":1,"column":12,"offset":11},"end":{"line":1,"column":102,"offset":101}}},"target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer","children":"《Fundamentals of Software Architecture》"}],"（下文简称 FOSA）一书中的课后思考题，来深入理解书中的核心概念和理论，从而提升我们的软件架构设计能力。本篇为",["$","u","u-0",{"children":"第十四章"}],"内容。"]}],"\n",["$","p","p-1",{"children":"本章的课后题是："}],"\n",["$","ol","ol-0",{"children":["\n",["$","li","li-0",{"children":["\n",["$","p","p-0",{"children":"What are the primary differences between the broker and mediator topologies?"}],"\n",["$","p","p-1",{"children":"代理拓扑（broker）和中介者拓扑（mediator）两种拓扑的根本区别是什么？"}],"\n"]}],"\n",["$","li","li-1",{"children":["\n",["$","p","p-0",{"children":"For better workflow control, would you use the mediator or broker topology?"}],"\n",["$","p","p-1",{"children":"为了更好的流程控制，你会选择代理拓扑还是中介者拓扑？"}],"\n"]}],"\n",["$","li","li-2",{"children":["\n",["$","p","p-0",{"children":"Does the broker topology usually leverage a publish-and-subscribe model with topics or a point-to-point model with queues?"}],"\n",["$","p","p-1",{"children":"在代理拓扑中，是经常使用基于主题的发布订阅模式还是基于队列的点到点模式？"}],"\n"]}],"\n",["$","li","li-3",{"children":["\n",["$","p","p-0",{"children":"Name two primary advantage of asynchronous communications."}],"\n",["$","p","p-1",{"children":"列出 2 个异步通信的主要优势。"}],"\n"]}],"\n",["$","li","li-4",{"children":["\n",["$","p","p-0",{"children":"Give an example of a typical request within the request-based model."}],"\n",["$","p","p-1",{"children":"举一个 request-based 模式的典型例子。"}],"\n"]}],"\n",["$","li","li-5",{"children":["\n",["$","p","p-0",{"children":"Give an example of a typical request in an event-based model."}],"\n",["$","p","p-1",{"children":"举一个 event-based 模式的典型例子。"}],"\n"]}],"\n",["$","li","li-6",{"children":["\n",["$","p","p-0",{"children":"What is the difference between an initiating event and a processing event in event-driven architecture?"}],"\n",["$","p","p-1",{"children":"在事件驱动架构中，初始事件和处理中事件二者有什么不同？"}],"\n"]}],"\n",["$","li","li-7",{"children":["\n",["$","p","p-0",{"children":"What are some of the techniques for preventing data loss when sending and receiving messages from a queue?"}],"\n",["$","p","p-1",{"children":"有哪些技术可以防止在从队列发送和接收消息时丢失数据？"}],"\n"]}],"\n",["$","li","li-8",{"children":["\n",["$","p","p-0",{"children":"What are three main driving architecture characteristics for using event-driven architecture?"}],"\n",["$","p","p-1",{"children":"使用事件驱动架构的三个主要驱动架构特性是什么？"}],"\n"]}],"\n",["$","li","li-9",{"children":["\n",["$","p","p-0",{"children":"What are some of the architecture characteristics that are not well supported in event-driven architecture?"}],"\n","$L8","\n"]}],"\n"]}],"\n","$L9","\n","$La","\n","$Lb","\n","$Lc","\n","$Ld","\n","$Le","\n","$Lf","\n","$L10","\n","$L11","\n","$L12","\n","$L13","\n","$L14","\n","$L15","\n","$L16","\n","$L17","\n","$L18","\n","$L19","\n","$L1a","\n","$L1b","\n","$L1c","\n","$L1d","\n","$L1e","\n","$L1f","\n","$L20","\n","$L21","\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n","$L22","\n","$L23","\n","$L24","\n","$L25","\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n","$L26","\n","$L27","\n","$L28","\n","$L29","\n","$L2a","\n","$L2b","\n","$L2c","\n","$L2d","\n","$L2e","\n","$L2f","\n","$L30","\n","$L31","\n","$L32","\n","$L33","\n","$L34","\n","$L35","\n","$L36","\n","$L37","\n","$L38","\n","$L39","\n","$L3a","\n","$L3b","\n","$L3c","\n","$L3d","\n","$L3e"]}]}],"$L3f","$L40","$L41"]}],"$L42"]}]]}]}]
