30:["$","ol","ol-4",{"children":["\n",["$","li","li-0",{"children":[["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"接收请求"}],"：响应方服务从",["$","strong","strong-1",{"children":"请求队列"}],"中消费一条消息。"]}],"\n",["$","li","li-1",{"children":[["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"处理业务逻辑"}],"：执行消息内容所要求的业务计算或操作。"]}],"\n",["$","li","li-2",{"children":[["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"提取元数据"}],"：从收到的请求消息的属性中，提取出 ",["$","code","code-0",{"className":"$undefined","children":"Reply-To"}]," 和 ",["$","code","code-1",{"className":"$undefined","children":"Correlation ID"}]," 的值。"]}],"\n",["$","li","li-3",{"children":[["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"构造响应消息"}],"：响应方创建响应消息，其内容是业务处理的结果。"]}],"\n",["$","li","li-4",{"children":[["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"设置并发送响应"}],"：在响应消息的属性中，",["$","strong","strong-1",{"children":"必须"}],"将从请求中收到的那个 ",["$","code","code-0",{"className":"$undefined","children":"Correlation ID"}],["$","strong","strong-2",{"children":"原封不动地设置回去"}],"。然后，将此响应消息发送到请求消息中 ",["$","code","code-1",{"className":"$undefined","children":"Reply-To"}]," 字段所指定的那个队列地址。"]}],"\n"]}]
